---
layout: base.njk
title: The NAVO Blog
description: Real stories, plain-English guides, and honest conversations about navigating aged care for your parents.
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-label">The NAVO Blog</div>
    <h1 class="hero-h">Real stories.<br>Plain-English guides.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Honest conversations about what navigating aged care for your parents actually looks like. No overwhelm – just clarity.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="posts-section">
  <div class="posts-inner">
    <div class="posts-label">Latest posts</div>
    {% if collections.posts.length %}
    <div class="posts-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <article class="post-card">
        {% if post.data.image %}
        <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" class="post-card-img">
        {% else %}
        <div class="post-card-img-placeholder"><span>NAVO Blog</span></div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="post-card-body">
          {% if post.data.tags %}
          <span class="post-tag">{{ post.data.tags[0] }}</span>
          {% endif %}
          <h2 class="post-card-title">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
          <p class="post-card-excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          <div class="post-card-meta">{{ post.data.date | dateDisplay }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ post.content | readTime }}</div>
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-card-link">Read more →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div style="text-align:center; padding: 4rem 0;">
      <h3 style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:0.75rem;">First post coming soon.</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.92rem; color:rgba(14,26,43,0.55); line-height:1.75;">Check back shortly – or stay connected and we'll let you know when new guides and stories are live.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-strip">
  <div class="cta-strip-inner">
    <h2>Not sure where to start?</h2>
    <p>Take the free 15-minute check-in and see exactly what you know, what's missing, and where to begin.</p>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a href="https://tally.so/r/gDN0BP" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-s">Start the free check-in →</a>
      <a href="https://shop.meetnavo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-gw">See the guides</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
